[options]
[A.]
            <h2>Slave to the King (Attack on Wind Village)<a href="#mission5">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
<p>
                                 ~[IrainBattery.*]~[Ianim.74]            ~[IwindArcher.75]<br>
                                               ~[Ibolt.17] <br>
                  ~[Ipriest.107]~[IsunCannon.3]          ~[Ianim.81]~[IwindBlocker.3]~[IwindArcher.82]    ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br><br>
    <i>This is your second mission in conquering the Nimbian Planes.</i>
<p>
                You must capture and kill the King of Wind Village.<br>
                           You must travel to the Realm of Wind.<br>
                             And sac them all - Take no prisoners!<br>
<br>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                 <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                    <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>             <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">To Wind Village</a>               <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I wanna Leave!</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,golemMove2.wav
<$Tell,sound1>
$Button= ,Tell,A.

[sound1]
<$Playsound,sunCannonFire.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound2

[sound2]
<$Playsound,fireCrossBow.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound3
[sound3]
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound4

[sound4]
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound5

[sound5]
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound6
[sound6]
<$Playsound,fireCrossBow.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound7

[sound7]
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound8

[sound8]
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound9
[sound9]
<$Playsound,fireCrossBow.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound10

[sound10]









[ai8PriestDead]
{sw_god5} speaks to you:<br>
<i>"That's it! Destroy all that opposes my Rule. No on can escape </i>~kDEATH<i>!</i>
$Menu=~[IwindArcher.75]~yCrossBow,GetTechnology,140

[ai6PriestDead]
You think to yourself, poor foolish Priests that stand in the way of my Master taking over Nimbus!
<p>
With each priest you sacrifice, you become more powerful, and more deserving of your Master's
praise!
$Menu=~yAirShip~[IwindBalloon.*],GetTechnology,141

[ai4PriestDead]
The {sw_god2}'s Priests are no match for you!
$Menu=~[IwindAviary]~yDevil Maker,GetTechnology,139

[ai7PriestDead]
<$ChangeMoney,1500>
The {sw_god5} says:<br>
<i>"Here is more storm power for you"</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai5PriestDead]
The {sw_god5} says:<br>
<i>"Here is food for your destruction: Storm power Crystals"</i>
<$ChangeMoney,5000>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0



[ai3PriestDead]
Here's some storm power crystals to help you in your destruction
<ChangeMoney,1000>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message.<br>
     ~[Ipriest.167] <p>
   ~r"Good job Apprentice!<br>
You really massacred that puny ~[ImanaBolt.0]~oWind~[ImanaBolt.0] ~rKing".<br>
                --Your ~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]King~[IsunFlyerBomb.4]</h2>
$Button=Thanks!,DoNothing,0


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<$Config,sw_m5=0>
<$Config,sw_m7=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=10000>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>

<h2>You receive a message.</h2><br>
     ~[Ipriest.167] <p>
<i>"Good job Apprentice! You are beginning to show me that I was right to allow
you to serve under me. Keep it up and I may appoint you my ~kDark Priest<i>, forever to
serve and pray unto ME!"<br>
                                --Your ~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]King~[IsunFlyerBomb.4]</i>
$Button=Thank you Master!,MissionBegin,sw_m7


[Failed]
You better retry this mission quickly before the {sw_god5} finds out.
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=10000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=2000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=9>
$Button=Try again,MissionBegin,sw_m5
$Button=Leave,Tell,guideHades.overview
[END]
